==Match==

===Summary===
Lazio scored the only goal of the game in the 35th minute when [[Marcelo Salas]] hit a shot from just inside the penalty box which goalkeeper [[Raimond van der Gouw]] got his hand to but failed to keep out as the ball went under his body.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://news.bbc.co.uk/2/hi/sport/football/432092.stm|title=Man Utd lose to Super Lazio|date=17 August 1999|website=BBC Sport|access-date=10 August 2022}}</ref>

